### AI02 invalid domain data: stock-controlled sellable product without stockUnitsPerSale
POST http://localhost:3000/planning/executions
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "forecastName": "Week-45",
  "scenarioName": "Autumn-Scenario",
  "referenceDate": "2026-11-05"
}

### Expected response when the forecast references PRD-MISSING-UNITS (422)
{
  "error": {
    "message": "Missing stockUnitsPerSale for SKU: PRD-MISSING-UNITS"
  }
}
